{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/extras/a9e154a34cdb9e63b73440532d54a205.avif?t=1750796079\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and Violet in an exciting twin-stick shooter... with a twist! <br>Match your shots to enemy colors and test your skills in this intense single-player challenge. Outsmart foes, take down mighty bosses, and reclaim your lost kingdom in a flower-themed adventure with global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Rose and Violet with a single controller, coordinating your shots using the analog sticks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in co-op mode as two players by sharing the controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bravest knights in the Flower Kingdom on their quest to reclaim liberty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight an army of robots, each with their own behavior and moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up to the top in the global leaderboards, clearing all levels in the shortest time possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of hand-drawn environments, helping Rose and Violet through their marvelous journey across the flower world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2856880?t=1750796079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750796079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/45225b60311bd421ffdb08899de359585bf68f5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750796079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/45225b60311bd421ffdb08899de359585bf68f5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750796079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856880/extras/a9e154a34cdb9e63b73440532d54a205.avif?t=1750796079\" width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and Violet in an exciting twin-stick shooter... with a twist! <br>Match your shots to enemy colors and test your skills in this intense single-player challenge. Outsmart foes, take down mighty bosses, and reclaim your lost kingdom in a flower-themed adventure with global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Rose and Violet with a single controller, coordinating your shots using the analog sticks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in co-op mode as two players by sharing the controller!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the bravest knights in the Flower Kingdom on their quest to reclaim liberty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight an army of robots, each with their own behavior and moveset!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up to the top in the global leaderboards, clearing all levels in the shortest time possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of hand-drawn environments, helping Rose and Violet through their marvelous journey across the flower world.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Pinkaro"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descrip